<title>TANZANIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>This is a revised Tanzania government list with the corrected spelling of Vice President Omar Ali Juma (Omar Ali Juma) not Omar Ali Jumia as in list sent on February 5.</p>
<p>TANZANIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970218)</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 23 Nov 95).........Benjamin William MKAPA</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Vice President...Omar Ali JUMA</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Formed 28 Nov 95, Reshuffled 4 Feb 97)</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Apptd 27 Nov 95).............Frederick SUMAYE</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Cooperatives.........Paul KIMITI</p>
<p> Children &amp; Women&quot;s Affairs...........Mary NAGU</p>
<p> Communications &amp; Transport......William KUSILA</p>
<p> Defence............Edgar MAJOGO</p>
<p> Education...........Juma KAPUYA</p>
<p> Energy &amp; Minerals..............Abdallah KIGODA</p>
<p>Finance &amp; Planning..Daniel YONA</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs..........Jakaya Mrisho KIKWETE</p>
<p> Health.............Aaron CHIDUO</p>
<p> Home Affairs................Ali Ameir MOHAMMED</p>
<p> Justice &amp; Constitutional Affairs..............Harith MWAPACHO</p>
<p>Labour &amp; Youth Development..Sebastian KINYONDO</p>
<p> Lands..............Gideon CHEYO</p>
<p> Natural Resources &amp; Tourism.......Zakia MEGHJI</p>
<p> Science &amp; Technology...........Jackson MAKWETA</p>
<p> Trade &amp; Industry..William SHIJA</p>
<p> Works.............Anna ABDALLAH</p>
<p> Water..............Pius NGWANDU</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Bank of Tanzania (Central Bank) Governor.........Idris RASHID</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			  (End Government List)</p>
